        "quote": "(a) A permit is required when a new or replaced backflow prevention device or assembly is installed. Before the placement of a backflow prevention device or assembly, the licensed plumber on new installation, and/or the certified backflow technician on replacements, shall obtain permits and inform the Development Services Division that the device or assembly is being installed. After installation or replacement, a certified tester/repair technician will then test the device or assembly and register it with the Backflow and Cross Connection Enforcement Official for scheduled testing.",
